 "word": " The"}, {"start": 430.57, "end": 431.21, "word": " cesspits"}, {"start": 431.21, "end": 431.39, "word": " of"}, {"start": 431.39, "end": 431.61, "word": " Dol"}, {"start": 431.61, "end": 432.15, "word": " Guldur"}, {"start": 432.15, "end": 432.45, "word": " have"}, {"start": 432.45, "end": 432.77, "word": " been"}, {"start": 432.77, "end": 433.39, "word": " emptied."}]}, {"start": 434.41, "end": 436.37, "text": " They're all in mortal danger.", "words": [{"start": 434.41, "end": 434.77, "word": " They're"}, {"start": 434.77, "end": 434.97, "word": " all"}, {"start": 434.97, "end": 435.39, "word": " in"}, {"start": 435.39, "end": 435.81, "word": " mortal"}, {"start": 435.81, "end": 436.37, "word": " danger."}]}, {"start": 436.59, "end": 438.03, "text": " What are you talking about?", "words": [{"start": 436.59, "end": 437.27, "word": " What"}, {"start": 437.27, "end": 437.41, "word": " are"}, {"start": 437.41, "end": 437.47, "word": " you"}, {"start": 437.47, "end": 437.73, "word": " talking"}, {"start": 437.73, "end": 438.03, "word": " about?"}]}, {"start": 438.31, "end": 440.55, "text": " I can see you know nothing of wizards.", "words": [{"start": 438.31, "end": 438.85, "word": " I"}, {"start": 438.85, "end": 439.03, "word": " can"}, {"start": 439.03, "end": 439.29, "word": " see"}, {"start": 439.29, "end": 439.43, "word": " you"}, {"start": 439.43, "end": 439.57, "word": " know"}, {"start": 439.57, "end": 439.89, "word": " nothing"}, {"start": 439.89, "end": 440.13, "word": " of"}, {"start": 440.13, "end": 440.55, "word": " wizards."}]}, {"start": 441.37, "end": 444.23, "text": " They are like winter thunder on a wild wind", "words": [{"start": 441.37, "end": 441.73, "word": " They"}, {"start": 441.73, "end": 441.87, "word": " are"}, {"start": 441.87, "end": 442.15, "word": " like"}, {"start": 442.15, "end": 442.59, "word": " winter"}, {"start": 442.59, "end": 443.03, "word": " thunder"}, {"start": 443.03, "end": 443.39, "word": " on"}, {"start": 443.39, "end": 443.47, "word": " a"}, {"start": 443.47, "end": 443.81, "word": " wild"}, {"start": 443.81, "end": 444.23, "word": " wind"}]}, {"start": 444.23, "end": 445.75, "text": " rolling in from a distance,", "words": [{"start": 444.23, "end": 444.75, "word": " rolling"}, {"start": 444.75, "end": 445.05, "word": " in"}, {"start": 445.05, "end": 445.25, "word": " from"}, {"start": 445.25, "end": 445.37, "word": " a"}, {"start": 445.37, "end": 445.75, "word": " distance,"}]}, {"start": 446.37, "end": 448.07, "text": " breaking hard in alarm.", "words": [{"start": 446.37, "end": 446.73, "word": " breaking"}, {"start": 446.73, "end": 447.43, "word": " hard"}, {"start": 447.43, "end": 447.77, "word": " in"}, {"start": 447.77, "end": 448.07, "word": " alarm."}]}, {"start": 448.91, "end": 453.33, "text": " But sometimes a storm is just a storm.", "words": [{"start": 448.91, "end": 449.63, "word": " But"}, {"start": 449.63, "end": 450.09, "word": " sometimes"}, {"start": 450.09, "end": 451.07, "word": " a"}, {"start": 451.07, "end": 451.47, "word": " storm"}, {"start": 451.47, "end": 452.19, "word": " is"}, {"start": 452.19, "end": 452.75, "word": " just"}, {"start": 452.75, "end": 452.95, "word": " a"}, {"start": 452.95, "end": 453.33, "word": " storm."}]}, {"start": 453.61, "end": 454.95, "text": " Not this time.", "words": [{"start": 453.61, "end": 454.13, "word": " Not"}, {"start": 454.13, "end": 454.55, "word": " this"}, {"start": 454.55, "end": 454.95, "word": " time."}]}, {"start": 455.67, "end": 457.77, "text": " Armies of orcs are on the move.", "words": [{"start": 455.67, "end": 456.39, "word": " Armies"}, {"start": 456.39, "end": 456.61, "word": " of"}, {"start": 456.61, "end": 456.97, "word": " orcs"}, {"start": 456.97, "end": 457.19, "word": " are"}, {"start": 457.19, "end": 457.33, "word": " on"}, {"start": 457.33, "end": 457.47, "word": " the"}, {"start": 457.47, "end": 457.77, "word": " move."}]}, {"start": 457.77, "end": 460.65, "text": " These are fighters